  "description": "A Fody weaver that lets you hook into the start, the end and the exceptions of methods by adding an attribute. The calls are woven into the IL at build time: no runtime proxy, and it also works for static, private, generic and async methods. Aspects get the arguments, the return value, the instance and the exception.",
